## General Figma-to-Unity issues (not from the files)

These are common problems with this kind of pipeline. Nothing in the files mentions them, so check whether they apply to you.
- **Scaling:** Figma frames are fixed-size, so you need to decide on anchors and canvas scaling for different screen ratios.
- **Fonts:** fonts have to be present and converted for Unity.
- **Effects:** Figma-only effects (blurs, shadows, blend modes) may not import faithfully.
- **Draw calls:** many separate images can hurt performance, so sprite atlasing matters.
- **Re-imports:** re-importing after a design change can overwrite manual fixes in Unity.


